!!!AFAIK!!!
PCI is only spec'ed at 32 bits.  So those 64 bit slots are only usable as 64
bits for very few specially made cards.  I don't know that people make in
production anything that is a 64 bit PCI product.  There may be a specially
made Alpha/Workstation 64 bit PCI card that you might be able to get.  But I
don't know of a standard for 64 bit PCI.  then again, I'm probably wrong like
always :)
