Ron, 1. I have not seen many 100Tx hubs that are not backward compatable? 
Granted that means you hose the rest of the network and it all has to run at
10, but to get things up and running, why not?	I intalled over FTP just the
other day and it tok 10 extra minutes than 100TX install.  Is your hub 100
