Let me describe my machine more carefully:-
It started as an NT machine with an internal hard drive on a scsiIII controller 
containing 2 partitions with NTFS and 1 DOS partition to boot the machine and
a scsiII controller with a CD drive.

I then deleted one of the NTFS partitions and installed linux and a swap partition.
/dev/sda1 is NTFS 
/dev/sda2 is DOS contains MILO ...  to boot machine
/dev/sda3 is swap
/dev/sda4 is linux /
/dev/scd0 is CDROM
