The Alpha is and will be a superior platform to anything intel for the
forseable future (assuming you can afford to upgrade at intel/Alpha chip rev
pace - ouch, that would hurt!).

the 264 promises to blow intel out of the water again (really it will, It
fixes many of the remaining weaknesses in the Alpha/RISC approach and wil be
a formidable processor.

the 364 promises to better that one more and guess what..they have a 464 as a
work in progress.

