little slice of the market, so long as they produce to meet the needs of that
slice and not some mythical hidden windows crossover market.

That is what Cost Jobs his "job" in the first place(in the 80's).  He seems to
have learned this time.

The short version is that Intel looks poised to fall on its face with the
MERCED and Windows is doing nothing to help with the delay and 32/64 bit
waffle on NT 5.0.

