multiplatform status.  If this keeps up, it could become a viable Os
alternative and shopping for a procesor would mean including all of the
options (PPC,ARM,INTEL,Alpha,MIPS...).	As they are, in principle, API
neutral for developers (at least to a far greater degree than anything
else!!!)

All of the peices are in place, it is going to be fun to watch.

