egcs.  I am using version 1.33 of the Qt libraries compiled with gcc. 
Other libraries include

libXext.so.6.3
libX11.so.6.1
libstdc++.so.2.8.0
libm.so.6.1
libc.so.6.1
ld-linux.so.2

