was that
I used the milo-avanti-980606 but the kernel and ramdisk had to come from
my Red-Hat CDROM. I downloaded many of the recommended kernels and
ramdisks from the web, but I always ended up with odd errors. Be ready to
have
problems when the system puts the filesystem on the hard disk, but keep
trying.
