kernels and ramdisks, I dont know if it would be as troublesome with the
red-hat
stuff. Also, don't forget the root=/dev/fd0 line in you boot sequence.

**Note, I ended up using the rawrite and the "avanti.img" kernel to get this
thing running. Let me know all the specific images and steps in your
milo boot process if you keep having problems.

